    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**SUBSTITUTE** replaces existing text with new text inside a cell: `=SUBSTITUTE(text, old, new, [instance])`. Text you type goes in quotation marks, and leaving out the instance replaces every match."
    },
    {
